      "side": 1,
      "message": "TL/DR; no\n\nThe license/license_kind feature was added to Soong with similar semantics and scope as bazel/blaze. In bazel/blaze, the existence of a BUILD file in a subdirectory defines an independent package carved out of the parent.",
